                                    p.mb-0 I focused on developing the next generation of leaders, coordinating with faculty to introduce new training programs and workshops, and organizing technical fests and coding events such as bug hunts.
                                .flex-shrink-0
                                    span.text-primary July 2016 - May 2017

                        .org-role
                            .d-flex.flex-column.flex-md-row.justify-content-between
                                .flex-grow-1
                                    h4.mb-2 Team Coordinator
                                    p.mb-0 My role as a team coordinator included organizing workshops for newcomers to college and leading the team to deliver them. The club focuses on teaching various languages and technologies, and conducts workshops and events covering C, C++, Java, Web Development, Android, MATLAB, Linux, etc.
                                .flex-shrink-0
                                    span.text-primary August 2015 - June 2016

